        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>电影字幕截图</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #222;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #6b5a4a;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  /* Top image area (photo of person wrapped in plaid blanket) */\n  .placeholder {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 130px;\n    background: #7a6553;\n    border: 1px dashed #cfc3b4;\n    color: #f0e8dd;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  /* Subtitle stack overlaying the lower portion of the still */\n  .subs {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #6d5c4c;\n    padding: 6px 0 10px 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .line {\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    margin: 0 0 9px 0;\n    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px #000;\n  }\n  .zh {\n    display: block;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .en {\n    display: block;\n    color: #efe9e2;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n    [Photo: top, full width — person standing indoors wrapped in an orange/red plaid blanket; dried plant bundle hanging on wall at right]\n  </figure>\n\n  <div class=\"subs\">\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">它不会像子弹射入胸膛</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">It doesn't actually kill you,</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">或是迎面而来的车祸　那样真的杀了你</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">like a bullet to the heart or a head-on car wreck.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">但是它会让你死</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">It should.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">当你至死不逾的爱人对你说</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">When someone you've promised to cherish till death do you part</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">我从未爱过你时　你立刻就被杀死了</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">says, \"I never loved you,\" it should kill you instantly.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">发生了这种事　你会成日混混沌沌</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">You shouldn't have to wake up day after day after that,</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">试图去理解这世界为什么会这样</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">trying to understand how in the world you didn't know.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">好像从未有过光明</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">The light just never went on, you know.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">当然　我们应该早就知道的</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">I must have known, of course,</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">但是我却如此害怕去看到事实</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">but I was too scared to see the truth.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">于是恐惧让你变得愚蠢</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">Then fear just makes you so stupid.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">不　这不愚蠢　梅丝夫人</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">No. It's not stupid, Signora Mayes.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">爱是盲目的</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">L'amore è cieco.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">\n      <span class=\"zh\">每个人都知道　因为它是条真理</span>\n      <span class=\"en\">Everybody has that saying because it's true everywhere.</span>\n    </p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
